  "description": "“Urban Gear presents a graffiti-inspired 3D font that embodies the audacious and vibrant energy of street art. Its deeply extruded design imbues every word with a distinctive depth and dimensionality, allowing texts to command attention vehemently. Crafted with edgy, manually sketched letterforms, Urban Gear aims to cause a stir, making it the ideal choice for ventures demanding the unrefined allure of the streets. From drafting head-turning posters and remarkable headlines to concocting eccentric branding, this font provides an unmistakable graffiti vibe that refuses to blend in. Urban Gear effortlessly injects an attitude, ingenuity, and street-wise chic into your design. It infuses the heart and soul of metropolitan culture in every single letter, making it the perfect font for those wanting to express a bold, urbane narrative.”",
  "fullDescription": "<p>“Urban Gear presents a graffiti-inspired 3D font that embodies the audacious and vibrant energy of street art. Its deeply extruded design imbues every word with a distinctive depth and dimensionality, allowing texts to command attention vehemently. Crafted with edgy, manually sketched letterforms, Urban Gear aims to cause a stir, making it the ideal choice for ventures demanding the unrefined allure of the streets. From drafting head-turning posters and remarkable headlines to concocting eccentric branding, this font provides an unmistakable graffiti vibe that refuses to blend in. Urban Gear effortlessly injects an attitude, ingenuity, and street-wise chic into your design. It infuses the heart and soul of metropolitan culture in every single letter, making it the perfect font for those wanting to express a bold, urbane narrative.”</p>",
